OL,3,AUS central bank keeps interest rates
OL,4,Aunchanged in final decision before
OL,5,Amidterm elections
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US central bank has left interest
OL,8,Frates unchanged in its final decision
OL,9,Fbefore the US midterm elections
OL,11,FLast month, the Federal Reserve raised
OL,12,Frates for the first time in three years
OL,13,Fto 3.75%-4%, hinting at additional
OL,14,Fhikes this year to help curb inflation
OL,16,FToday's decision was not unanimous with
OL,17,Ftwo of the 12 board members voting to
OL,18,Fraise rates
